window.products.push({"id":1160031,"name":"GreenForest L Shaped Gaming Desk 58.4\" Corner Computer Desk Reversible Table with Large Monitor Stand for Home Office PC Laptop Workstation, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rikjDIwWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy L Shaped Desk: The \"Z\" style design legs and triangle support give the l-shaped desk an extra support and stability. Made of interior-grade particle board on top and thick steel frame, this durable construction desk is bulit to last that can hold 100 lbs. \"Z\" design offers a plenty of legroom under desk and you can also put a file cabinet for storage. With this sleek design, it will blend in well with any decor in your home, making it a splendid addition in any room style. Reversible L Shaped Corner Computer Desk with Large Desktop Space: With the defferent length of one side being 58.4*19 inches and the other 44.4*19 inches, you can mount it on either the right or left side depending on your preference. The computer desk offers you large space for at least 3 monitors, and helps you spread out for daily working, gaming, reading enjoyment and engineering drawing. The reversible design allows you to use 2 desk to form a U shaped workstation for multi persons space. Gamer Friendly L Gaming Desk: Need a break? There are 2 rest bars for your feet to make long periods sitting more comfortable which is more ergonomic. If the floor is uneven, don't worry, this gaming desk comes with adjustable footpads to keep itself level and stable, making sure you get a best gaming experience in the intense game battle. L Desk with Large Monitor Stand: On the top of office table, there is a removable monitor stand 19\"*9.5\"(L*W)that is large enough to hold computer, laptop or even a speaker. With the suitable height, the monitor riser keeps your computer at eye-level with comfortable view and improves your sitting posture for better health benefits. And it's movable that can be fixed anywhere on the desktop space for your need. Space Saving Corner Desk: The l shaped corner desk can carve out a dedicated space in your home for computer activities and other office taskes. It's friendly to corner positioning that maximizes your limited space in bedroom room, home office room and home entertainment center. Overall dimensions: 58.4\"(L) x 44.4\"(L) x 19\"(W) x 29.8\"(H).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rikjDIwWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreenForest","source_asin":"B09TW2KFRS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TW2KFRS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TW2KFRS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
