window.products.push({"id":1160041,"name":"Wake Up Light Alarm Clock for Kids 7-12, Ok to Wake Clock for Kids 3-6, Toddler Sleep Trainer, Digital Alarm Clocks for Bedrooms with Night Light, Sle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C0DokW2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【THOUGHTFUL, ADORABLE DESIGN FOR YOUR KID】After two years effort from design to finish production, this childrens sleep trainer clock DONNA launched and soon gained numerous recognition for its thoughtful features and cute design. With this sleep training clock for toddlers DONNA, we hope to help the kid get more sleep and make the parenthood just get easier. 【KEEP YOUR KID IN BED LONGER AND GET MORE SLEEP】This sleep trainer clock for kids DONNA uses color and facial expressions to teach the kid when it's time to sleep and when it's OK to wake up (or “almost wake” with green light glowing 30 Mins before wake up time). For ages 3-5, Select OK to wake clock for kids with green light only to wake up kids in a pleasant way by sliding to \"Light alarm\". For ages 6-12, Select standard alarm clock for kids with 9 mins snooze by sliding to \"Sound alarm\". 【ALL-IN-ONE SLEEP TRAINER GROWS WITH YOUR KID】Besides the sleep clock and wake up clock features, this toddler clock DONNA also features 10 soothing sleep sounds (8 volume levels) and touch sensitive night light (4 brightness) and 8 color light to soothe your kid to sleep. This toddler sleep training clock also features 5 natural wake up sounds. This kids alarm clock also features both a nap timer with a sound or light alarm and stop watch for naps and timed activities for older kids. 【CHILD SAFE AND DURABLE CONSTRUCTION】This kids alarm clock OK to wake DONNA is made of child safe ABS and silicone, it is FCC, CE, RoHS approved. The big chamfer design in shape make this toddler alarm clock more safe for kids to use. This sleep clock for toddlers has a built-in backup battery to preserves time memory settings. This wake up clock also has a child lock to prevent curious kids from changing the clock settings, only 4 brightness LCD display is enable in child lock mode. 【PERFECT GIFT, BRING DELIGHT TO YOUR KID】This cute alarm clocks for bedrooms kids DONNA is a perfect gift for children, boy or girl, heavy sleeper kids. Best gift for birthdays, baby showers, thanksgiving day, Christmas and more. This kids alarm clock sleep trainer is also one of the ideal kids room decor, it will bring delight to you and your kid. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE AND ONE YEAR WARRANTY. If you are not satisfied with our kids digital alarm clock, contact our customer support team!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C0DokW2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KASCIMU","source_asin":"B09NSVDHK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NSVDHK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NSVDHK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
