window.products.push({"id":1160155,"name":"Small Tube Pan (Leaf)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BM8EMT0IL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","description":"Bake your cakes in style with our decorative cake pans. These classic shapes are ideal for bundt cake recipes and a variety of delicious desserts including pound cake, fruitecake, angel food cake, cinnamon buns, chiffon cake and many more. Simply pour batter into paper cake pan... bake and serve","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BM8EMT0IL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welcome Home Brands","source_asin":"B007PSNRK0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007PSNRK0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007PSNRK0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1160156,"name":"Early Fall Along the River by Kurt Shaffer, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vEIDjszkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a photograph of a river in the fall. Kurt Shaffer has been a self-taught photographer since age 13 (1970). He continues to learn the fine art of photography, especially in this fantastic digital age. Though Kurt does not manipulate his fine art photography, digital enhancement is a valuable tool in his business. He states that if he were to change anything in his work it would be to make it look more like it was when he took the original photo. Kurt's love of the earth feeds his photographic creativity and defines it as his truest form of therapy. When photographing people, capturing the nature in his subjects is Kurt's intent and what he strives to do. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vEIDjszkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLY9N0C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLY9N0C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLY9N0C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1160157,"name":"Toilet Paper Basket for Back of Toilet - Set of Two Small, Wicker, Hyacinth Bathroom Baskets for Toilet Paper and Towel Storage (Color: Light Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-oJwkB7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All-natural boho beauty combines with home organization to craft the perfect set of Hyacinth storage baskets. Whether arranging hand towels, storing extra rolls of toilet paper, or other household items like office supplies, this set of wicker baskets is sure to become your go-to storage option for every room in your home.  Here’s why this set of storage baskets from VintageNooks are “Bohotastic”:   Two sizes All-Natural Waterproof Handcrafted Stylish storage  Space-saving Durable  So before you stick extra rolls of tp or paper hand towels on the back of your toilet or bathroom countertop, treat your bathroom accessories and yourself to this stunning set of Boho-style storage baskets.   Dimensions: Large Basket: 13.4” x 6.7” x 4.0” Small Basket: 11.8” x 5.5” x 3.5”   Color: Light Tan Weave","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-oJwkB7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VINTAGE NOOKS","source_asin":"B0BXVGVKS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXVGVKS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXVGVKS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
