window.products.push({"id":1160234,"name":"Coaster Home Furnishings Stanton Rectangular Dining Table Black 102061","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":590.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qsdeDIf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This striking wood dining table from the Stanton Collection adds charisma to your casual dining room. The table is made from ash veneers and features a contemporary wave design on a square column base finished in a rich black. With different chair options to choose from, the overall look and feel are up to you. This everyday dining table is the consummate gathering place for you and your loved ones to enjoy great meals and good times. A matching server with cabinets and shelving for ample storage of extra dinnerware and silverware would be an excellent accoutrement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qsdeDIf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coaster Home Furnishings","source_asin":"B004LNSDBU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004LNSDBU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004LNSDBU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1160235,"name":"SUMGAR 3 Piece Wall Art Living Room Large Flower Canvas Paintings Modern Yellow Grey Pictures Kitchen Gray Floral Prints Bedroom Framed Artwork Set Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O7URzKPGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ABOUT SUMGAR WALL ART: Since 2006, Sumgar wall art has been obsessed with one thing: providing customers with premium quality wall art anywhere.  Sumgar has its own factory. According to the designs of its team, it makes products in different styles, including oil paintings on canvas, acrylic paintings, Mixed-media paintings, Watercolor paintings, Wood wall art. In order to fulfill the requirements of different customers, it designs products of different styles, such as modern art, contemporary art, abstract art, famous art and pop art. DOUBLE STRENGTHENING TECHNOLOGY: The back of the wooden frame is both nailed and sealed with white masking tape. PERFECTLY CUT CORNERS FOR A CLEAN LOOK: Stretching canvas on a frame is an age-old practice that requires skill and knowledge. Sumgar’s team of experts hand-stretch each canvas to perfection and ensure the corners are perfectly folded and tucked. PACKAGE INCLUDES: canvas prints 2 Screws 2 Screw fixing plastic wall plugs Installation instruction MORE ITEMS: If you want more choices, please search “ sumgar wall art ”. SPECIFICATIONS: * Brand: SUMGAR * Subject: Floral * Material: Wood, Canvas * Package: Carton * Color: Yellow,Grey * Dimensions: 16\"x24\"inchx3pcs * Framed: Yes * Number of Pieces:3 We hope you're pleased with your SUMGAR Art purchase. TIPS: Due to different brand of monitors, actual wall art colors may be slightly different from the product image. If you can't put the obvious holes on the wall, hang them with the command hooks or push pins or nails.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O7URzKPGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUMGAR","source_asin":"B07K8FBXYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K8FBXYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K8FBXYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1160236,"name":"Strathwood 6-Piece All-Weather Furniture Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IiYQF0TaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com 6-piece outdoor furniture set includes 2 chairs, 2 ottomans, a loveseat, and a coffee table. view larger 100-percent polyester cushion covers and 4 throw pillows included. view larger Furniture features durable yet lightweight steel frames with black powder-coated finish. view larger Fabric ties with Velcro for securing the cushions to the frames. view larger Coffee table with semi-transparent smokey glass top. view larger Modern angles and unique curves offer enhanced visual appeal. view larger Strathwood Basics 6-Piece Furniture Set The Strathwood Basics outdoor furniture set helps transform any porch, patio, or back deck into a quiet oasis from the rest of the world and a welcoming place to visit with friends and family. Powder-Coated Steel Construction The attractive and versatile six-piece outdoor furniture set includes two chairs, two ottomans, a loveseat, and a coffee table. The pieces provide frames made of durable, lightweight steel with a black powder-coated finish that resists rust and stands up to the elements. Even more, the frames combine reliable support with modern angles and unique curves for modern flair and enhanced visual appeal. The rectangular-shaped coffee table offers smooth, tapered edges and a semi-transparent smoked glass top that wipes clean easily. Cushions and Pillows Included The chairs, ottomans, and loveseat come with cushions for enhanced comfort. Each cushion provides a 100-percent polyester cushion cover in slate gray with piping along the edges for a neatly tailored look. In addition to the cushions, the set also includes four throw pillows with a striped pattern in various shades of earthy-colored hues. Fabric ties with Velcro make it easy to secure the cushions to the frames. Coordinates with Surrounding Decor Tastefully designed, the six-piece furniture set blends in nicely with existing pieces and beautifully accommodates almost any decor. Some assembly is required for the coffee table; all other pieces come fully assembled. The table measures 22.8 inches long by 17.7 inches wide by 42.5 inches high and weighs 24.3 pounds. Each chair measures 26.8 inches long by 29.7 inches wide by 31.1 inches high and weighs 8.5 pounds. Each ottoman measures 22.6 inches long by 12.8 inches wide by 19.7 inches high and weighs 7.8 pounds. The loveseat measures 50 inches long by 29.7 inches wide by 31.1 inches high and weighs 34.4 pounds. Cushion Care and Cleaning Gently brush off dirt before it becomes embedded in the fabric and wipe up any spills as soon as they occur. Gently spot clean only with mild soap and cool water using a sponge or soft brush, then air dry the cushion in a sunny location. All pieces should be brought indoors or securely covered during inclement weather and stored in a dry place when not in use. Please note: Upholstered items purchased on different occasions over time may have a slight variation in hue. This is normally expected between rolls of like fabric, since no two can be produced to come out exactly the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IiYQF0TaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Strathwood by Amazon.com","source_asin":"B0094B928M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0094B928M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0094B928M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
