window.products.push({"id":1160261,"name":"Cast Leather Co., Teapot Cosy Handmade from Full Grain Leather - Pot Cover to Insulate and Keep Liquids Warm - Tea Time Accessory, for Large and Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b818MA0VL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"TEA TIME ESSENTIAL: Our handmade Teapot cosy is the perfect tea time accessory for keeping your tea or water warm. Simply cover your large or small teapot and the cosy will insulate your pot, keeping the contents warmer for longer periods of time. Made from durable, heat resistant, full grain leather, this cosy can withstand the heat from your teapot and it will help to protect your hands up to 450 degrees Fahrenheit or 232 degrees Celsius. Impress your tea party guests with this unique cosy. MATERIAL TYPE: Full Grain Leather - Our products are built to withstand the wear and tear of everyday use. Each product is handmade from top quality, full grain leather, making these accessories ready for the outdoors and suitable for various weather conditions. When you need dependable protection from intense heat in the kitchen, you can count on Cast Leather Co. products. We know that these durable products will go a long way to help you serve the best dishes. MATERIAL ORIGIN: Jalisco, Mexico - our high quality, full grain leather is sourced locally in the beautiful Mexican state of Jalisco. Known all over the world for its agave cactus, strong tequila and mezcal, traditional folklore, mariachi music, wide deserts and picturesque landscapes, Jalisco has become a bustling center of trade and unique materials, and proudly bears the status of a perfect example of modern and traditional Mexico, bursting with tradition and beauty. MAKER LOCATION: Antigua, Guatemala – Here at Cast Leather Co., each one of our products is handmade by local artisans of Antigua, Guatemala, a town renowned for its craftsmanship of artisanal goods. We hand-cut and finely hand stitch our products using a tried and true method, resulting in a durable finish and a lifetime of use. Any loose ends are passed over with an open flame to prevent any unravelling. MAKES A GREAT GIFT + LIFETIME GUARANTEE: Cast Leather Co. proudly stands behind its products and knows that this unique, handcrafted product will make an excellent gift for friends, family and loved ones, whether for birthdays, Christmas, or any special occasion. What’s more, we include a 100% Lifetime Customer Satisfaction Guarantee, so if at any point you are not satisfied with your purchase, just get in touch with us so we can make it right with a replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b818MA0VL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cast Leather Co.","source_asin":"B09PHXGLKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PHXGLKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PHXGLKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
