window.products.push({"id":1160317,"name":"KYERLISH Pour Over Kettle with Thermometer, Stainless Steel Gooseneck Kettle, Drip Coffee Kettle, Gooseneck Tea Kettle（500ml/18oz）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TfRjiIpTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Built-in Thermometer and Scale Mark]KYERLISH stainless kettle comes with an auto temperature gauge(Celsius and Fahrenheit). You don't need to move the kettle's lid or use an independent thermometer to measure the temperature. The precise temp probe with a golden zone indicator also helps you brew coffee at the optimal temperature (195-205°F). This kettle has a built-in Scale Mark(Ounce and Milliliter), which enables you to add desired water volume. [Unique Gooseneck Spout Design]Smooth and stable water flow is essential in making drip coffee. This coffee kettle has a specialized gooseneck spout for precise water flow. The design of the coffee kettle spout is more curved than most of the market. Pour the right amount of water and pour at the right speed for perfect coffee extraction. [Ergonomic Handle for Ultra Comfort]The pour over kettle has a heat-resistant wooden handle. Compared with other materials, the wooden handle is more slip-resistant and heat-resistant and feels more comfortable to the touch, which avoids scalding when pouring water. The combination of the black body and natural wood color also creates a sense of luxury. [High-Grade 18/8 Steel and Excellent Craftsmanship]This hand drip coffee kettle is made from premium food-grade 304 stainless steel, which can prevent rust. Delicate craftsmanship ensures no leak at the joint. The triple layer leak-free base can work on all stovetops: gas, electric, radiant, halogen, and induction stove. Please be careful of avoiding fire be close to the wooden handle. [Worry-Free Purchase]We provide exquisite coffee-related products. Even if you are new to pour over coffee, you can brew delicious coffee with KYERLISH pour over kettle with ease. You can use it at home, in the office, outdoors, and so on. Enjoy your leisure time with this lightweight kettle. We cover a 1-year worriless warranty from the date of purchase. Please be rest-assured to buy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TfRjiIpTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kyerlish","source_asin":"B097NWKC2B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097NWKC2B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097NWKC2B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
