window.products.push({"id":1160342,"name":"KOKO Robot Vacuum Cleaner Dry Sweeping and Wet Mopping for Wood Floor Automatically Sweeping Scrubbing Mopping Floor Cleaning Robot (Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A9EJncGnL._AC_.jpg","description":"Instructions for use 1.There are two kinds of wipes in the package, beige or purple wipes (finer hairs) are used to wipe dry dust, can not be used with water. Mainly used to adsorb dust and hair, blue or light gray wipes (thicker hair) are wet mop wipes, dry wipes after removing and cleaning as far as possible, and then put on the machine to use. Mainly used for mopping floor. Use a dry wipes first. Dry wipes must not be stained with water, otherwise the machine can not walk! Dry wipes are ultra-fine fiber material, adsorption for dust hair is very good, wet wipes have strong water absorption, dedicated to mop land! 2. Mopping floor function Introduction: Can Adsorb ash, and a small amount of short hair. There is no vacuum cleaner function, mainly wipe the floor and mop the floor! Can not sweep the floor, large particles of garbage can not be disposed of! For the first time to use, please clean the bottom of the bed, or pay attention to garbage out from the floor from the bottom of the bed cabinet, to prevent garbage from being pushed everywhere, when using wet wipes on tile floor, try to spray a small amount of water to use, otherwise it may slip, if there is in situ skidding, dry wheel or move a place where is not mopped, and it will be improved. 3.Charging time is about 6 hours, blue lights do not blink with full of charge, use for about 2 hours, the machine pauses every half an hour, remind you to replace the towel, press the switch again to work again for 30 minutes. Dry wipes need to first shake off the clutter, if there is debris can not be shaken, use the waste comb to scrape down the hair, and then clean and dry, you can continue to use. Scope of Use: Suitable for hard floors such as marble floors, tiled floors, wooden floors, etc. Remove dust, stains, hair, cotton wool and other fiber objects from the ground. Note: the machine is not available for Soft ground such as carpets!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A9EJncGnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"koko robot","source_asin":"B07QD8WGVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QD8WGVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QD8WGVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
