window.products.push({"id":1160441,"name":"YnM Kids Weighted Blanket — Heavy 100% Oeko-Tex Certified Minky Material with Premium Glass Beads (Flamingos, 41''x60'' 7lbs), Suit for One Person(~60","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IIlnlDOAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The original YnM minky weighted blanket offers a natural way to help calm and warm your body for a restful night of sleep Made with multiple layers and smaller compartments (4''x4'') for maximum comfort that contours to the shape of your body Our unique 7-layer structure is designed to keep you comfortable and cool, allowing the glass beads to provide temperature control Use this weighted blanket on its own or with a duvet cover; great gift for every age To choose a size, take 10% of your body weight, then add 1 lb; great calming sensory blanket for adults and children to help decompress and provide comfort","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IIlnlDOAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YnM","source_asin":"B07RYLV4R8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RYLV4R8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RYLV4R8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1160442,"name":"Rymbo String Lights, 34ft Indoor/Outdoor Star Shape Lights LED Warm White Twinkle Lights & USB Powered &Transparent String Cable & Remote Adapter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SednEtDYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Color:Star string lights (Warm White)You need led Stars string lights to create a romantic atmosphere in a beautiful day such as Mother's Day, Christmas Eve, Christmas day, weddings, birthdays, parties, Festivities or some other romantic moments. Say goodbye to your traditional battery operated string lights, you need to be more convenient, premium quality lights - indoor/outdoor USB globe string lights. Feature: Mini and artistic appearance, it is easy to carry. Romantic light, it looks very beautiful in the night. Low power consumption, safe and reliable It can be put or hung on walls, windows, doors, floors, ceilings, grasses, christmas trees etc. perfect decoration for Valentine's Day, Christmas, other holidays, party, wedding, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SednEtDYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rymbo","source_asin":"B074N3NTVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074N3NTVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074N3NTVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1160443,"name":"Kahler Omaggio Medium Ceramic Vase - Handmade Faience (White / Pearl)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618SieHUojL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Omaggio series is a modern design classic. The iconic hand-painted stripes are represented in countless Nordic homes and loved by design enthusiasts all over the world. This 7.9 inch high vase in white with pearlescent stripes is available with stripes of other colors (subject to availability). Other products are available in the Omaggio series, including different sized vases, matching serving bowls and dishes (search for \"Kahler Omaggio\"). The Omaggio vase, made from faience ceramic, is in fact an interpretation of the historical Kahler vases from the early and mid 20th century. The modern Omaggio vase was inspired by Tulle Emborg, one of the talented women painters in Kahler's Danish workshop in the 1930s and 1940s. As in the old Kahler workshop, each and every stripe has been hand-painted by talented women painters. The vases then go through multiple hand processes in connection with glazing, quality checking and fine polishing. In this way, your Omaggio vase is not only a modern design icon, but also a piece of Nordic cultural history which has been reinterpreted and revived by the talented designer duo Stilleben (Ditte Reckweg and Jelena Schou Nordentoft). \"We have always been totally fascinated by Kahler's epoch-making ceramics, which have played an enormous part in putting Denmark on the map when it comes to art and design. It is a great pleasure to help bring the art ceramics heritage into a new era and a new form language\", say the two designers. It is Kahler's mission to create accessible art for the people. Now a leading Scandinavian design brand, their roots go back to 1839 as a small Danish pottery producer. For more than 175 years, their tradition has been to collaborate with significant artists to provide distinctive and contemporary collections. Kahler is firmly established as part of Danish cultural heritage, and they strive to preserve history and traditions in each handmade design. Height 200mm (7.9 In.) Diameter 165mm (6.5 In.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618SieHUojL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kahler","source_asin":"B01DUXAEPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DUXAEPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DUXAEPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
