window.products.push({"id":1160487,"name":"TEXARTIST Twin Extra Thick Mattress Pad Cooling Mattress Pad Cover 400 TC Cotton Mattress Cover Quilted Fitted with 8-21 Inch Deep Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616OMAvilAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extra Thick Double Border Pillow Top Design Adopted the newly developed \"Double Border Pillow Top\" Construction, this mattress pad is filled with 50% more filling than other pads on the market, defeating standard thin topper easily. Snow down alternative filling creates the perfect balance between soft and support. You can enjoy the luxury with an affordable mattress pad at home. Ultra Breathable 400TC Combed Cotton Surface 400 TC Combed Cotton offers soft and cool touch. Combed Cotton soothes your senses and creates appropriate temperature to sleep easily for a whole year round. It will just wick away moisture and keep your body dry. Forget the heat from foam mattress, try this breathable mattress pad. Deep Pocket Fits Mattress Perfectly Twin: 39\" x 75\"+18\"/Twin XL: 39\" x 80\"+18\"/Full: 54\" x 75\"+18\"; /Full XL: 54±x80±+18\"/Queen: 60\" x 80\"+18\"/Olympic Queen: +18\"/King: 78\" x 80\" +18\"/California King: 72\" x 84\"+18\". You can choose one to perfectly wrap and protect your mattress. Now say goodbye to shifting, you deserve a good night sleep. Machine Washable And Tips For Care Since our product is packaged in a vacuum bag, we advice to tumble dry the mattress pad on low heat before use to let the air fluff it up. It is easy-care that can be washed in machine in gentle cold water cycle. Avoid top loader machines. Please don’t iron, bleach or dry-clean it. A fitted sheet/mattress protector is highly recommended to use. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION AFTER SALE SERVICE A good product always keep accepting helpful advice from customers. We provide 100% customer after sale service. If you’re unsatisfied with our mattress pad, please contact our after sale team at any time. We will make quick response to fix your problem. Welcome to try TEXARTIST mattress pad.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616OMAvilAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEXARTIST","source_asin":"B088DD173G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088DD173G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088DD173G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
