window.products.push({"id":1160872,"name":"Homevam Toilet Brush Holder Cleaning Set - Silicone Toilet Brush Handle with Holder Detachable Drip Drawer Tweezers and Silicone Brush Bathroom Sink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LWV6FaMqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOMEVAM Toilet BrushSet is carefully designed to address your every need in keeping your toilet bowl in great shape. Every component is well-thought-out, making it an attractive investment for your bathroom. There are two main things that make our product notable. First is its silicone bristles easy to clean, fast-drying and will not get tangled with hair. Its TPR material is also firm enough to scrape off stains and debris from your toilet’s surface but it’s not that abrasive to scratch it and won’t wear out quickly. Second attached on the other end of the brush is a tweezer that will let you pick up small items. Also, easy to place with the aid of the included sticker: can be placed on the ground, or can be hung on the wall to save you space. With these, you don’t really need to make lots of additional purchases to outfit your bathroom of cleaning tools. HOMEVAM Toilet Brush Set comes with a very easy, waterproof PP and aluminum handle. Comfortable to hold in your hand, non-slip design, you don't have to press for perfect cleaning. There’s enough air circulation in the brush holder to keep your bathroom floor dry, away from smelly. The brush can easily access hard to reach areas of the toilet for a more thorough cleaning. It can also be more easily and thoroughly cleaned than plastic-bristle brushes since plastics are particularly sensitive to chemicals and physical stress. Its space-friendly dimensions complement bathrooms of all sizes, and HOMEVAM Toilet Brush Set with its innovative design will not fail in bringing a touch of elegance to your bathroom, while providing practical storage. Clean thoroughly your toilet with the first swipe with HOMEVAM Toilet Brush Set and your bathroom will look gorgeous and will make cleaning an enjoyable and fulfilling experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LWV6FaMqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homevam","source_asin":"B087M9WVSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087M9WVSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087M9WVSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
