window.products.push({"id":1160900,"name":"Kitchen Mat and Rug Topper, Natural Bamboo Protector Cover for Kitchen Floor, Carpets, Runners and Area Rugs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zba+LOr5L._AC_SL1449_.jpg","description":"Get your beautiful NATURAL BAMBOO KITCHEN MAT today.  NON SLIP  This kitchen mat seamlessly blends fashion and function. Not only is its modern, minimalist look incredibly stylish, it offers you safe, solid footing on wet or slick surfaces where you can easily slip and fall. Silicone non skid rubber pads are positioned underneath to protect your floors and carpets, and stop the mat from sliding.   INDOOR / OUTDOOR  Bamboo floor mats are easier to clean and maintain than foam and textile kitchen rugs and give any room an instant style upgrade. Swap one out with your dirty old kitchen mat, and place them around kitchen area for safe, secure footing even when faced with high traffic and damp conditions. Each multipurpose mat can be rolled or folded for fast, easy storage.   NATURAL BAMBOO  At ZPirates, we use premium seasoned bamboo wood with industrial monofilament fibers for maximum strength. Our bamboo mats are lighter than teak rubber mats and much more durable. They will not stain, sag or bend for long-lasting use indoors or outdoor.   DURABLE, WATERPROOF FINISH  The seasoned bamboo undergoes a high-temperature water and sugar removal, making the mat cleaner and tougher. It is also coated to prevent scratching and staining to preserve the pristine finish. The lattice design lets water flow through to prevent it from pooling on top and also allows air to circulate to better preserve the wood.   EASY TO CLEAN  Measuring 34 x 16 x 0.3 inch, our bamboo wood mats are North American standard in sizes. To clean, spray with water or wipe with a damp cloth. The ZPirates team takes pride in the quality of our products. If you are not satisfied with your mat, please let us know. Get your beautiful and tough bamboo kitchen mat today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zba+LOr5L._AC_SL1449_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZPirates","source_asin":"B08LPH3GCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LPH3GCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LPH3GCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
