window.products.push({"id":1160944,"name":"Coir Doormat with Heavy Duty Backing, Dog Paw Print 23.5”x15.75”, Anti-Slip Coco Coir Door Mat, Indoor/Outdoor Front Door Home Mats for Entry, Patio, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815JakNB5YS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❀DURABLE MATERIAL: The coir doormat is made of coconut palm fiber extracted from the coconut shell. Coir palm fiber is known for its strength and durability. It is not easy to wear and can be used for a long time. The backing of the mat is made of thick rubber, which is more resilient, not easy to break and fall off, and can extend the service life of the coconut coir mat to a large extent. ❀MAKE YOUR HOME TIDIER: Compared with other floor mats, the bristles of the coco coconut palm mat stand upright and have stronger scraping and water absorption capabilities. Before entering the home, you can use the welcome mat to wipe the dust, dirt, snow, grass and debris on your shoes or boots to reduce the entry of external dirt, thereby protecting the floor, tiles and indoor carpets. ❀EASY TO CARE: We use advanced technology to perfectly fuse the coconut palm fiber on the backing of the doormat, which makes it difficult to shed hair. The mat will absorb dirt in the gaps of the coconut palm fiber. If your coir doormat is dirty, you only need to take the mat to an open space and shake it gently to shake off the dust, or you can use a stiff brush and vacuum cleaner to remove the debris remaining in the coconut palm fiber. ❀APPROPRIATE SIZE: This coir door mat has 2 sizes to choose from, which can meet your different needs. This size is 23.5\" x 15.75\", which is not only suitable for single use but also suitable for use with other large cushions, such as a buffalo lattice rug. The height of the mats is 0.6 inches, which prevents them from getting stuck on the open door and you can easily open or close your door. ❀WIDE RANGE OF USE: The entrance mat has a very wide range of use, and is suitable for indoor and outdoor entrance, Including front porch, terrace, garden, garage, backyard, laundry room, kitchen, and other areas, or any entrance or exit with heavy traffic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815JakNB5YS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HTHOOOOOME","source_asin":"B08Z8J7TC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1160944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z8J7TC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z8J7TC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
